{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1337323-a-whole-dragon-of-troops-and-statted-npcs-for-your-use","id":1337323,"title":"A whole Dragon of troops and statted NPCs for your use","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-09-22T08:26:44-07:00","id":1337323,"title":"A whole Dragon of troops and statted NPCs for your use","content":"This is actually a family of (mostly Air) Outcastes for my game, so it's not exactly the same as a Realm legion; they use Shogunate titles, and there's two shamans, which you probably wouldn't get in a Realm Legion. I haven't included the intimacies, as they're quite specific to my game. But it's extremely easy to adapt for your own games.<br /> <br /> I've only really given them combat stats: I didn't bother writing in the Fire spymaster's larceny and investigation charms, or the Water Aspect's sail and bureaucracy charms, etc, etc. But combat stats are the most hassle generally I find.<br /> <br /> Most importantly, they are designed so that it's really easy to run Aura with them. Lots of balanced charms, a few Aura that match their Aspect. Aura's often a big hassle when running a whole bunch of NPCs fighting your Solars. But when we ran them vs the Lunar PCs, it was pretty easy.<br /> <br /> So I hope people find this useful.<br /> <br /> Kazei Jadis. <b>Air, \u201c</b>the white witch\u201d. Travels in a chariot. Likes giving sweets to children. Katsunaga's wife.<br /> Shozei Katsunaga, <b>Earth</b>. Fights with a massive tetsubo. Jadis's husband.<br /> Deputy is Tazei Umi, <b>Air</b>. Jadis's cousin. Fights with her mother's daiklaive, Shining Ice Mirror.<br /> Shozei \u2013 Hatsuno, <b>Air</b>, \u201cFlashing Spear Lioness\u201d. Amazing with her jade spear. Glory-seeker, but also professional. Jadis's cousin.<br /> Deputy is Tazei Saizo, blind <b>Earth</b> swordsman and master tactician. Yukihiro's lover and Jadis's great-nephew.<br /> Tazei Nemaja, <b>Water</b>, she wields a magic umbrella and is in charge of the Dragon's boats. Pretends diffidence but actually a vicious monster. Not related to the others.<br /> Tazei Yukihiro, <b>Fire</b>. In charge of spying operations for the Dragon Jadis's second cousin once removed.<br /> Tazei Samatsu, Fire. Not related to the others.<br /> Shugenja Goji, <b>Fire.</b> Seems friendly but actually very manipulative.<br /> Shugenja Itsuko, <b>Water</b>. Interested in ancient lore and the occult.<br /> <br /> <u><b>Kazei Jadis, \u201cThe White Witch\u201d, Air sorceress, Essence 3</b></u><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Str 4, Dex 3, Sta 4, Per 3, Int 4, Wits 3<br /> Athletics 3, Awareness 2, Dodge 3, Brawl 3, Occult 5, Ride 5 (+1 sleigh), Resistance 4, Thrown 5 (+1 icicle-javelin), War 5<br /> <br /> Join Battle 5 dice<br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Icicle-javelin 13 dice at close range, 12 at short (13 damage, Overwhelming 1, can make Piercing attacks. Enemies who take decisive damage from it take a -1 penalty to all actions until their next turn)).</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Parry 3 Evasion 3 Soak 7 (light armour)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Guile 4 Resolve 4</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Her sleigh is Speed +2 (11 combat movement) and gives +1 Defence except against reaching weapons.</span><br /> <br /> Willpower 8<br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Personal Essence 14/14</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Peripheral Essence 35/35 </span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Health levels: </span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">0/-1/-1/-1/-1/-2/-2/-2/-2/-4/Incap</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Weapon charms:</u><br /> <b>Dragon-Grace Weapon</b> (3m, reflexive. Create and ready an icicle-javelin. Enemies who take decisive damage from it take a -1 penalty to all actions until their next turn)<br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><u>Defence charms:</u></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Stoking Bonfire Style</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> (Excellency. If hit or parry, reduce cost by 1 vs that opponent for rest of scene. Lost if attack/parry another enemy or miss/fail to parry.)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Impervious Skin of Stone</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> (4m, reflexive, +4 soak. Activated after being hit.)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Air Anima</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> (</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">For three motes, the Air Aspect may deflect projectiles with a gust of wind, imposing a \u22121 environmental penalty on all ranged attacks against her until her next turn. )</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><u>Ranged charms:</u></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Seeking Throw Technique</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> (excellency, ignore 1pt of cover or 2 if you aimed.)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Elemental Bolt Technique </b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">(4m, Simple. Close range 13 dice to hit, 12 at short range. Can spend one anima for 8 at medium range. Damage 13, Overwhelming 4. Reduce armoured soak or hardness from metal by 3.)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><u>Movement charms:</u></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Air Anima </b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">(5m, she can use her reflexive move action to leap an entire range band vertically or horizontally without needing to roll, and suffers no falling damage for the rest of the round. At bonfire, this power is free.)</span></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Scattered Pearl Hoof falls</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> (Excellency, successes for 2m only, ignore 1pt penalty from barding.) </span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Heaven Racing Leap</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> (4m, reflexive, can leap one range band forward. In Air Aura, can leap a range band up as long as it can land somewhere that can bear its weight. Alternatively, on a rush or disengage can reroll a non-1 dice per 10 you rolled.)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Cloud-Harnessing Technique</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> (5m, reflexive. Until next turn, can run across and stand on surfaces that wouldn't bear its weight, and ignore difficult terrain.)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Tread Rooted in Life</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> (4m, reflexive, one scene, ignore movement penalties for wind and bad weather.)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><u>Sorcery:</u></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Hidden Secrets Whispers</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> (excellency, each 10 re-rolls a non-1 failure)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Five Winds Raiment </b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">(3m, 1a, lasts for a whole shaping attempt, and gives +1 defence and Hardness 4. If in Air aura, it's non-charm.)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Dragon Sorcerer Puissance </b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">(Gain 1 free sorcerous mote per shaping roll on elemental spells, or 3 on Air spells if in Air aura.)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Thunder Wolf Howl </b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">(15sm, 1wp. Pick a point in medium range, all characters within short range of that point roll Sta+Res diff 4. Battle Groups suffer a -Size penalty. Split her initiative evenly amongst targets and add 3 dice for bashing. Affected targets are deafened and take a penalty equal to the number of 10s on all rolls. The penalty falls by 1 a round.)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Cirrus Skiff</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> (18 miles per hour)</span><br /> <b>Beckoning That Which Stirs the Sky</b> (Control spell)<br /> <br /> <u>War charms:</u><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Tactics Mean Everything </b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">(excellency, re-roll 6s)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Excellence of the Dutiful General</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> (5m, convert up to 3 dice of situational bonuses on a Strategic Manoeuvre roll to non-charm successes.)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Tireless Footfalls Cadence </b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">(3m, ignore penalties from fatigue and strenuous movement on a Strategic Manoeuvre roll. If she wins the roll and implements her strategem, then her battle groups ignore all penalties from fatigue in the fight.)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Changing Winds Cunning </b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">(3m, re-roll 3 non-1 failures on a Strategic Manoeuvre roll)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Storm-Calling Strategos </b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\">(10m, 1wp, [5i]. Creates a unique difficulty 3 Strategic Manoeuvre to control the weather. If she wins, then after you roll Join Battle enemy battle groups take a -3 penalty on all physical actions. Non-battle group enemies may suffer a -1 penalty on appropriate rolls. The weather doesn't impede Jadis or her allies. If she has 12+ initiative, can pay 5i as her action to create an environmental hazard against one enemy battle group, difficulty 4, damage 8L)</span></div></div> </div> </div> <u><b>Shozei Katsunaga, Earth Samurai, Essence 3</b></u><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Str 5 Dex 2 Sta 5 Cha 4 Man 2 App 2 Per 3 Int 3 Wits 3<br /> <br /> Athletics 5, Melee 5 (+1 Heavy weapons), Awareness 5, Resistance 5, Integrity 5, War 5 (+1 small units).<br /> Other appropriate abilities are at 3. Others are at 1.<br /> Equipped with medium armour and a tetsubo.<br /> Join Battle 8 (+5 dice or +2 successes)<br /> Attack pool 8 (+6 dice, cost reduces against single opponent), Damage +16 (17 with Strength of Stone), Overwhelming 1<br /> Smash attack -1 defence, costs 2i, +1 damage from earth stuck around tetsubo. Success knocks enemy prone or back a range band.<br /> Soak 10<br /> Parry 3 (+3, cost reduces against single opponent)<br /> Evasion 0<br /> Resolve 4<br /> Guile 2<br /> <br /> <u>Charms</u><br /> <br /> Melee:<br /> Stoking Bonfire Style (+dice. If hit or parry, reduce cost by 1 vs that opponent for rest of scene. Lost if attack/parry another enemy or miss/fail to parry.)<br /> Flame-Born Interception (4m, reflexive, +1 parry until next turn. Goes up by 1 each time you successfully block. Resets if you fail to block)<br /> Falling Mountain Fang (2m, 1wp. Can do gambits: Weight down Weapons, Weight Down Armour, or Collapse Structure. P227)<br /> Dragon-Graced Weapon (Already activated, summoned tetsubo with rockiness, +1 on smashing damage).<br /> <br /> Athletics: Strength of Stone Technique (5m, +1 strength for a scene, already activated.)<br /> <br /> Resistance:<br /> Impervious Skin of Stone (4m, reflexive, +5 soak. Activated after being hit.)<br /> Earth Bears Witness (5m, 3i, reflexive, reduce decisive damage by 5, but shunts it into nearby stone.)<br /> Immovable Mountain Technique (5m, reflexive, one scene, perilous, he can't be knocked back, down, thrown in a grapple, etc)<br /> Ox-Body x3<br /> <br /> War: Tactics Mean Everything (excellency, re-roll 6s)<br /> Roaring Dragon Officer (3m, Perilous, can flurry a command and non-attack action at -2 penalties only, no defence penalty.)<br /> Enfolded in the Dragon's Wings (3m, 1i, reflexive, perilous. Roll 10 dice [+6, re-roll 6s with excellency] and each 2 successes gives them +1 soak and +1 defence).<br /> <br /> Willpower 6 Initiative 9<br /> Personal Essence 14<br /> Peripheral Essence 0/35<br /> Health levels: <span style=\"color:#ff3333\">0/-1/-1/-1/-1/-1</span>/<span style=\"color:#ff3333\">-2/</span>-2/-2/-2/-2/-2/-2/-2/-4/Incap<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">For five motes, +3 natural soak and +1 Hardness until her next turn, as well as gaining +1 Defense against smash attacks and grapple gambits as a non-Charm bonus. At bonfire, this power is free.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">For three motes, ignore one point of penalty from wounds, poison, or crippling for a single tick. </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">May spend two Initiative when he rolls anima flux to either knock all damaged foes prone or knock them one range band away from him.</span></span></span><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <u><b>Shozei Hatsuno, \u201cFlashing Spear Lioness\u201d, Air spearwoman, Essence 3.</b></u><br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Strength 3, Dexterity 5, Stamina 3, Perception 3, Int 3, Wits 3<br /> Awareness 3, Athletics 4, Melee 5 (+1 Spear), Dodge 4, Resistance 3, War 3, Lore 3, Thrown 5 (+1 Javelins), Integrity 3.<br /> <br /> Join Battle 6<br /> Jade Direlance: <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Attack 12 dice (17 damage, Overwhelming 5, reaching, can make Piercing attacks). +2 extra dice when clashing.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Jade Direlance: Decisive Attack 11 dice. +2 extra dice when clashing.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Icicle-Javelin throw at short range: Withering attack 14 dice (12 damage, Overwhelming 1, can make Piercing attacks. Enemies who take decisive damage from it take a -1 penalty to all actions until their next turn)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Parry 7 Evasion 5 Soak 8 Hardness 4 (Jade Chain Shirt)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Guile 3 Resolve 3</span><br /> <br /> Willpower 5<br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Personal Essence 14/14</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Peripheral Essence 26/35 </span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">Health levels: </span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">0/-1/-1/-1/-2/-2/-2/-4/Incap</span></span><br /> <br /> <u>Weapon charms:</u><br /> <b>Dragon-Grace Weapon</b> (3m, reflexive. Create and ready an icicle-javelin.)<br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><u>Awareness charms: </u></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Precision Observation Method</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> (Excellency.)</span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><u>Melee charms:</u></span><br /> <span style=\"fo